{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0184_1000_p", "source_sha256": "22a90fcab5a7ed8ce2ac40014d6bd15a44998644501c80d4a7c94e752a91708f", "ja": "（真の出演するドラマの撮影が、無事に終了した。\n真は、主人の育に仕えるメイドの役だったが……）", "zh": "（真出演的电视剧顺利杀青了。真饰演的是侍奉主人育的女仆，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0184_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8884259c4c5f8c73b407617e1d9db17f6d5e5068122f3fcc756481988595f486", "ja": "お疲れさま、真。\n撮影、順調に終わったみたいだな。", "zh": "辛苦了，真。\n拍摄似乎顺利结束了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0184_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "af7e9654cecddd2b699e608724ce2002db34d0fae7fb9cd727759e7f832de525", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}！\nはい、全力でメイドを演じきりました！", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}！\n是的，我已经全力演绎完女仆了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0184_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "cb828e17f1fe491d57e69badbb51fed5dd213f0bfb715f8852690d27834598f9", "ja": "育の演じる主様や同僚の執事・歩との絆も描きつつ、\n手に汗握るバトルもあり……撮影、楽しかったです！", "zh": "在描写育饰演的主上与同僚管家步之间的羁绊的同时，\n还有让人捏一把汗的战斗……这次拍摄真开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0184_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f5df938fe8e55751a6c6b7ceab53412b86197c820a48b47ac0c2d91bd1240e93", "ja": "色々な要素が入ってたけど、上手く\n演じきってたもんな。さすがだよ。", "zh": "虽然加入了各种各样的元素，但你还是演绎得很好。真不愧是你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0184_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "b3547143a0f5d78347bd013d5463c6f302fb81c05e33b551e9321dcf82719782", "ja": "へへっ、ありがとうございます！\nボク自身、今回はすっごく気合い入ってたんです。", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢你！\n我这次也是干劲十足呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0184_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "47dff124c8bbe091fb7e5c36b701bc7c886488f2869f5d9e08466abc81ba59aa", "ja": "お気に入りの少女漫画とイメージが近いから、\n自分の中で、こうしよう！　って考えがあって……。", "zh": "因为和我喜欢的少女漫画风格很接近，所以我自己心里就有了“就这样来吧！”的想法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0184_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "e5c6a73ba8316eab939ddf6f8968ff7f56e09a35785bf978aaca7099c5448c81", "ja": "メイドと主様の関係性は、まさに『わた召！』でした\nからね！　頑張らない理由がありませんよ！", "zh": "女仆和主人之间的关系，正是《わた召！》里的那种关系嘛！所以根本没有不努力的理由啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0184_1008_p", "source_sha256": "788247009d11c309be5043b9a473fb054d8038d1b5ec56b2460f969e3accba8d", "ja": "なるほど。好きなものになぞらえたことが、いい\n結果に繋がったってことか。いいことだと思うよ。", "zh": "原来如此。也就是说，把它比作喜欢的东西，最终带来了好的结果啊。我觉得这是件好事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0184_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f1d517e1786def935ca43981145669051253bed7888aa2ffa64d13c6324d8ed0", "ja": "ところで……\n『ワタメシ』って、どういう漫画なんだ？", "zh": "话说回来……\n《ワタメシ》是部什么样的漫画？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0184_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "a2c09ec559333d6f5633d866e33032f2438f349cdc5b8fd0310265143018e1dd", "ja": "えっ！　あ、すみません……！　すっかり、\n{$P$}も知ってると思ってて……。", "zh": "诶！啊，对不起……！我还以为……{$P$}先生也知道呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0184_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "b34b10fe47595de5aa7edbec245ad1a9c0eccf2d46f20a408f23b39c27aad29f", "ja": "『わたしの召使いさん！』って少女漫画のことです！\n小さな主人に仕える、メイドさんの話なんですよ。", "zh": "是指一部叫《我的仆人！》的少女漫画啦！\n讲的是侍奉小主人的女仆的故事哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0184_1012_p", "source_sha256": "8bc46298d7f31ca52e86db7f27dab11d6754b5e9435ee686c48c466527b81799", "ja": "おお。『わた召！』か……なるほど。\n勉強不足だったな、ごめん。", "zh": "哦。《我的女仆！》啊……原来如此。\n是我孤陋寡闻了，抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0184_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "8f2ded925bee0303d572e027fa24dddbe1b1ae47bada98968ae542dc2a57eedc", "ja": "結構な人気作だし、有名な漫画ですけど、\n完結したのが5年前なので、仕方ないですよ。", "zh": "虽然是相当受欢迎的作品，也是很有名的漫画，但它完结都已经是5年前的事了，所以也没办法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0184_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "41cfd4d46bce6b273d5208d4253f960ca1dae3584c45d6755cc31ee833b9cdc6", "ja": "……あっ、そうだ！　{$P$}、\nせっかくなので、『わた召！』に興味ないですか！？", "zh": "……啊，有了！{$P$}，\n难得聊到这个，您对《我召！》有兴趣吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0184_1015_p", "source_sha256": "41f36e81407fcf184057bba52141cf0a2d2adc6dc3afd96fa9c7c94d83f67a08", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。真がそこまで夢中になる作品なら、\nちょっと読んでみたい気もするよ。", "zh": "啊，是啊。既然是真那么着迷的作品，我也有点想读读看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0184_1016_006mak", "source_sha256": "5dbd0ff377311f78d7bf0ef31e30f16481448a2219ab37f1d500c41f4aa7d3de", "ja": "それならボク、今度、全巻持ってきますよ！\nイッキ読みがオススメです！", "zh": "那我下次把全套都带来给你吧！\n推荐一口气看完！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0184_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "ca37be3ef4384349f2121d6befe5c475fdc7dccc4327c5332a240ccddddb12f1", "ja": "知らないなら、逆に、今から楽しめるってことですもん\nね。ちょっと{$P$}が羨ましいなぁ。", "zh": "不知道的话，反过来说，从现在开始就能好好享受了嘛。有点羡慕{$P$}呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0184_1018_p", "source_sha256": "af870923659edf61966d862539858567f31c1b14cc778bee9d97e1807fa21327", "ja": "ははは。ちょうど最近、寝る前にちょっと読めるような\nものを切らしてたんだ。軽めの漫画はありがたいな。", "zh": "哈哈哈。最近正好看完了睡前能读一会儿的东西，正发愁没得看呢。轻松的漫画可真是帮大忙了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0184_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "f2a67d6afb60bc856d9c9cdd98f0427cee640ffdf5a4d18b2795f09423de172e", "ja": "任せてください！　ボクが{$P$}を、\n少女漫画の世界に、夢中にさせてみせますから！", "zh": "交给我吧！我一定会让{$P$}沉浸在少女漫画的世界里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0184_1020_006mak", "source_sha256": "d821424feb2adc3b337fbd93b23c9b554a640f4f0682bbbffe86f580a058374f", "ja": "それじゃ、さっそく明日持ってきますね。\n『わた召！』……全42巻を全部！　へへっ♪", "zh": "那么，我明天就带过来哦。\n《わた召！》……全42卷，一本不漏！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0184_1021_p", "source_sha256": "b00dc85adbda91a1f88cae3d32d5ead08c4553200ea4d2bb506c26253245ff1d", "ja": "ああ、楽しみに……って、42巻全部！？\nいきなりそれは多すぎ……って、真！？　おーい！", "zh": "啊，我很期待……等等，全部42卷！？  \n一下子这也太多了……等等，真！？喂——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0184_1022_p", "source_sha256": "8441e1a434045a2b68c26af3bcfce921884126df80711f45a8e23e814c4b5162", "ja": "（着替えに行っちゃったか……。まあ、真があんなに\n勧めてくれるんだ。気合い入れて読むか……42冊）", "zh": "（她去换衣服了吗……不过，真这么热情地向我推荐。那我就打起精神来读吧……42册。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
